<title>USA: General Dynamics unit wins tank contract.</title>
<headline>General Dynamics unit wins tank contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Army said Wednesday it has awarded a $100 million adjustment to General Dynamics Land Systems on its contract for 120 upgraded M-1A2 tanks and related equipment.</p>
<p>It said the work will be part of the company's $1.3 billion contract to build 600 M-1A2 tanks over five years.</p>
</text>
